  "summary_en": "IFR member blog by the Russian Association of Robotics describing five trends in Russian robotics: government digitalisation policy, educational robotics demand, service robot growth, industrial robot uptake, and SME-oriented offerings. Notes planned AI and robotics regulation to reduce legal risk and a state-funded R&D roadmap.",
